### Directwerk API — HTTP client index
###
### Setup
### 1. Start API: ./gradlew :directwerk-app:bootRun  (SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=local via .env)
### 2. Copy http-client.private.env.example.json → http-client.private.env.json
### 3. Set platformAdminPassword, seedPassword, and client secrets to match Directwerk/.env
### 4. Select the "dev" environment in the HTTP Client gutter
###
### Run files in order for full local validation.
### Do not run 21-public-rss.http and 22-private-rss.http concurrently against the same
### tenant (both toggle PODCAST_RSS); serialize them via this index order or CI.
###
### | File | Controller / source |
### |------|---------------------|
### | 01-health.http | Actuator |
### | 02-oauth2.http | POST /oauth2/token |
### | 03-auth.http | AuthController |
### | 04-me.http | MeController |
### | 05-public.http | PublicSiteConfigController, PublicSubscriptionProductController |
### | 06-platform-tenants.http | PlatformTenantController |
### | 07-platform-modules.http | PlatformModuleController |
### | 08-platform-admins.http | PlatformAdminController |
### | 09-platform-tenant-users.http | PlatformTenantUserController |
### | 10-tenant-admin.http | TenantAdminController |
### | 11-tenant-products.http | TenantSubscriptionProductController |
### | 12-tenant-subscriptions.http | TenantSubscriptionController, TenantSubscriberController |
### | 13-module-probes.http | ModuleProbeController |
### | 14-security-probes.http | SecurityProbeController |
### | 15-multi-tenant-isolation.http | TenantContextFilter + domain verification |
### | 16-platform-audit.http | PlatformAuditController |
### | 17-media-upload.http | MediaController (2c/2d) |
### | 18-platform-tenant-media.http | PlatformTenantMediaController |
### | 19-podcast-content.http | Podcast content controllers (Phase 3) |
### | 20-episode-stream.http | MeEpisodeController, PublicEpisodeDownloadController |
### | 21-public-rss.http | RssFeedController public feeds/enclosures + FEATURE_NOT_ENABLED |
### | 22-private-rss.http | MeFeed + private feed/enclosure + FEATURE_NOT_ENABLED (after 21) |
### | 23-entitlements.http | Product access rules and subscriber entitlements |
### | 24-articles.http | ArticleController + PublicArticleController (Write desk) |
### | 25-tenant-subscriber-feeds.http | TenantSubscriberFeedController (list/enable/disable) |
### | 26-stripe-billing.http | Stripe Connect, checkout, portal, dashboard, webhook |
### | 27-custom-feeds.http | MeFeed custom feeds + private RSS format filter (after 19 + 22) |
###
### Controllers live under de.pnnit.directwerk.controller.*

### @name healthSmoke
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: application/json
